<title>UK: LucasVarity year pretax profit 282 mln stg.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity year pretax profit 282 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		N/A		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) N/A		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     282		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,600		  vs 4,426</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results proforma before exceptionals.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 276.1 and 290 million stg.</p>
<p>The company set a dividend of 2.25p for the period ended January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>LucasVarity said it planned to recommend a total dividend of 4.5p per share for the year to January 31, 1998. In addition, the company planned to buy back up to 3.0 percent of shares outstanding during the 1997 financial year.</p>
<p>Full company name - LucasVarity Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
